.SH NAME
git-work-issue-get - Print one issue whole


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-work issue get ID [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the whole issue: its fields, its people and its comments.

.PP
get pairs with set at the document level, so there is no per-field getter:
a field is \fBgit work issue get ID | jq .fields.status\fR\&.
ID is an id prefix or an alias.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-f\fP, \fB--format\fP="json"
	Select the output formatting style. Valid values are [json,text]

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for get


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgit-work-issue(1)\fP
